## Endpoints

### Auth Flow (2)
- `GET /ims/social/v2/providers` — Get available social providers for authentication.
- `POST /ims/check/v6/token` — Validate an Adobe Identity Management Service (IMS) token.

### Data Read (2)
- `GET /json/` — Retrieve Behance data in JSON format.
- `POST /v3/graphql` — Query Behance data using GraphQL.

### Data Write (3)
- `POST /ee/irl1/v1/interact` — Record user interactions on Behance.
- `POST /ee/v1/interact` — Record user interactions on Behance.
- `POST /signin/v1/audit` — Log sign-in attempts for auditing purposes.

